The SmolVLM image processing and prompt construction port code from two
upstream sources.

The resize-to-longest-edge and tile geometry, the tiling into rows and columns
with a global view, the rescale and normalization in runtime/media.cpp, and the
image token expansion in runtime/prompt.cpp follow image_processing_smolvlm.py
and processing_smolvlm.py of Hugging Face Transformers 5.2.0:
https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/tree/v5.2.0/src/transformers/models/smolvlm
config.py's CHAT_TEMPLATE reproduces chat_template.json of the
HuggingFaceTB/SmolVLM2-500M-Video-Instruct checkpoint, revision
7b375e1b73b11138ff12fe22c8f2822d8fe03467 (Apache License 2.0), which
runtime/prompt.cpp renders. The two Transformers files carry these headers:

