The Lanczos resize in runtime/media.cpp (filter, coefficient bounds, 22-bit
fixed-point weights and rounding, the 8-bit horizontal and vertical passes and
their order) is adapted from Pillow 13.0.0, src/libImaging/Resample.c:
https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/blob/13.0.0/src/libImaging/Resample.c

